async function acceptInvite(id=inviteCurrent?.id,inv=inviteCurrent,reciprocal=false){if(!inv||!user)return;try{if(!reciprocal){const sender=await get(ref(db,`users/${inv.from}`));if(sender.val()?.status!=="online"){toast("The challenger is no longer online.");await remove(ref(db,`invites/${user.uid}/${id}`));closeModals();return;}}const roomId=push(ref(db,"rooms")).key;const members=reciprocal?[user.uid,inv.from]:[user.uid,inv.from];const room={status:"setup",players:members,playerNames:{[user.uid]:userData.username,[inv.from]:inv.fromName||"Player"},boards:{[user.uid]:randBoard()},ready:{},calledNumbers:[],turn:null,createdAt:serverTimestamp(),rematch:{}};await set(ref(db,`rooms/${roomId}`),room);await update(ref(db,`users/${user.uid}`),{activeRoom:roomId,status:"in_game"});if(!reciprocal){await update(ref(db,`invites/${user.uid}/${id}`),{status:"accepted",roomId});await remove(ref(db,`invites/${user.uid}/${id}`));await set(ref(db,`outgoingInvites/${inv.from}/${id}`),{status:"accepted",roomId});}closeModals();listenRoom(roomId);toast("Match found. Arrange your board.");}catch(e){toast(e.message||"Could not create match.");}}
